# Supervisor / Home Assistant API captures. These embed live credentials (for
# example add-on ingress tokens), so they must never be tracked - see the
# repo-hygiene job in .github/workflows/tests.yml.
apps.json*
*-apps.json
*.har

# Generated verification output (Playwright, live checks)
test-results/

# Reports and analysis artifacts: reviews, threat models, validation reports and
# implementation plans. They are outputs of a review or a test run rather than
# sources of the product, so they are kept locally and out of version control.
# Enforced by the repo-hygiene job in .github/workflows/tests.yml.
*-report.md
*-REPORT.md
THREAT-MODEL.md
implementation_plan.md

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# External reference clones
/android/
/core/
/frontend/
/iOS/

# Agent customizations
.agents/
